OL,3,GNEWSAStormont to decide on #100 payment
OL,4,Ato NI homes after budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont ministers will have to agree a
OL,7,Fscheme for making a #100 payment to
OL,8,Flower income households in Northern
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FIt comes after the Chancellor John
OL,12,FHealey announced the payment for
OL,13,Fhouseholds in England, based on how
OL,14,Fmuch council tax they pay.
OL,16,FDelivering his first Budget Healey said
OL,17,Fmoney will be made available to
OL,18,FStormont to fund an equivalent scheme.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
